==Event Information==
<!--Event Information based on the latest version, October 9th, 2019-->
Amazing! The Battle Cats is officially {{Color|#FF0000|'''5 Years Old'''}}!<br>
To those of you who have been here since the beginning... THANK YOU!!! WE LOVE YOU!<br>
And to our new friends in the Cat Empire... the adventure is only just beginning!

Okay, enough with the sappy stuff... it's time to partyyyyyyyyyyyy!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Celebrate with us between September 20th (11am) and October 12th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Platinum Ticket Sale!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Between October 7th (11:59am) and October 11th (11:59pm)'''}}, purchase a Platinum Ticket to use at the Platinum Capsules!<br>
Using this ticket will give you a 100% chance of drawing an Uber Rare Cat!<br>
This incredible offer will only be here for a short time, so don't miss out!<br>
<small><small>※Each user will only be able to purchase one Platinum Ticket during this campaign.<br>
※If Platinum Tickets do not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.<br>
※Seasonal Event Cats, Collab Event Cats, and Girls & Monsters Cats are not available from this Platinum Capsule set.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●First-Draw Discounts Reset!'''}}<br>
All players get a big discount on your first Capsule draw of Battle Cats Year 5!<br>
The cost of your {{Color|#FF00CC|'''first single draw'''}} will drop from the usual 150 Cat Food to only {{Color|#FF00CC|'''30 Cat Food'''}}!<br>
The cost of your {{Color|#FF00CC|'''first 11-Capsule draw'''}} will drop from the usual 1500 Cat Food to only {{Color|#FF00CC|'''750 Cat Food'''}}!<br>
<small><small>※You must update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats to access this discount.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 5th Anniversary Dojo Ranking Event!'''}}<br>
Get your strongest Cat fighters ready, the Dojo Ranking Event is here for the 5 Years celebration! Time to prove yourself!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Starts on September 23rd (11am) and finishes at October 12th (10:59am)!'''}}

Head to the Catclaw Dojo from the Battle Cats Title Menu and enter the Arena of Honor to join in the challenge!<br>
Climb to the highest tiers of power as your scores are measured against all other Battle Cats players? Can you make it to the top 10%?<br>
Try as many times as you like before the event ends! In celebration of 5 Years of Battle Cats, the prizes this time are even bigger and better than usual!<br>
Plus, {{Color|#FF0000|'''If over 50,000 players take on the Arena of Honor, everyone earns a bonus reward of 100 Cat Food!'''}}<br>
Prove your skill and earn top-tier Arena prizes!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Earn tons of XP during the XP Festival!'''}}<br>
XP Festival!is back again! Get ready to power up your Cats to the max with special stages!

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Blitz XP Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Odd Days (10/1, 10/3, 10/5, 10/7, 10/9, 10/11)　11:00 AM ～ 2:00 PM'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Even Days (10/2, 10/4, 10/6, 10/8, 10/10) 　7:00 PM ～ 10:00 PM'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・XP Megablitz Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Odd Days (10/1, 10/3, 10/5, 10/7, 10/9, 10/11)　7:00 PM ～ 10:00 PM'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Even Days (10/2, 10/4, 10/6, 10/8, 10/10)　11:00 AM ～ 2:00 PM'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・XP Colosseum Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''10/1, 10/4, 10/7, 10.10　4:00 PM ～ 5:00 PM'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''10/2, 10/5, 10/8, 10/11　10:00 PM ～ 11:00 PM'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''10/3, 10/6, 10/9, 10/12　8:00 AM ～ 9:00 AM'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Merciless XP Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''10/1, 10/4, 10/7, 10/10 10:00 PM ～ 11:00 PM'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''10/2, 10/5, 10/8, 10/11　8:00 AM ～ 9:00 AM'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''10/3, 10/6, 10/9　4:00 PM ～ 5:00 PM'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 5th Anniversary Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Enter the 5th Anniversary limited map {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Birthday Present!'''}} and earn a {{Color|#FF0000|'''20 Cat Food'''}} reward the when you clear the stage! But wait...! Even though the stage disappears when you clear it each day, it will reappear again at {{Color|#008000|'''0:00 each day during the event period'''}}, along with the {{Color|#008000|'''Cat Food rewards'''}} that will reset and be once again available to collect as a clear reward!<br>
Plus, earn a one-time bonus {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''30 Cat Food'''}} reward the very first time you clear the stage!<br>
<small><small>※ If stages do not appear during the advertised event period, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Back for a short time only: Monthly Event Stages!'''}}<br>
Monthly Event stages will appear for 2 days each throughout the event.<br>
Get sweet stage clear rewards and unlock limited characters!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● English version only Stages and Awakened Stages!'''}}<br>
Take on the limited edition stage {{Color|#FF0000|'''Minced Meet-Up'''}}, and collect the English version-only unit [[Catburger (Special Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Catburger'''}}]]!<br>
Then, head to the Awakened Stage to claim the power of {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Catburger's third form'''}}!<br>
Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this event to challenge the limited stage {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catburger Awakens'''}}! get a chance to unlock Catburger's all-new true form!<br>
<small><small>※ Upgrade Catburger to level 20 to reveal the Evolve option in the Upgrade screen! ※ If you have not collected Catburger, you can still collect its third form as a drop reward and use it once you meet the Evolve conditions.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Special adventure areas for your GAMATOTO Expedition!'''}}<br>
Send your brave Gamatoto explorers to hunt for treasures at {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''XP Harvest (Easy, Normal, Hard)'''}} and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}}!<br>
Get even bigger item and XP rewards, check 'em out today!

・{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}}: September 20th (11am) thru October 1st (10:59am)<br>
・{{Color|#FF00CC|'''XP Harvest'''}}: October 1st (11am) thru October 12th (10:59am)

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Limited Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!

{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・Catfruit Capsules'''}}<br>
September 20th (11:00am) through October 1st (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・Catseye Capsules'''}}<br>
October 1st (11:00am) through October 12th (10:59am)

<small><small>※The Catfruit Limited Capsules provide Catfruit and XP rewards, while Catseye Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes and XP!<br>
※Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed, and Catseye Limited Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules once User Rank 1600 is reached.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Treasure Festival, On Now!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Treasure Festival'''}}, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#008000|'''even days'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''on odd days'''}} head to {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, Treasure Festivals in {{Color|#82318E|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} also appear on an irregular schedule!<br>
<small><small>※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Weekend Sales: Get Special Units for 50% off their usual Cat Food cost!'''}}<br>
Unlock Special Cats and complete your collection! During Weekend Sale periods, all normally available Special Cats that can be unlocked with Cat Food can be picked up for just half the Cat Food cost!

{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Sale #1: September 20 (11am) ~ September 23 (10:59am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Sale #2: September 27 (11am) ~ September 30 (10:59am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Sale #3: October 4 (11am) ~ October 7 (10:59am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Sale #4: October 11 (11am) ~ October 12 (10:59am)'''}}

Get the Special Cats you want most for cheap!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Login each day during the event for rewards and to unlock a limited edition Cat!'''}}<br>
Collect another login stamp the first time you visit the Cat Base each day during this 5th anniversary event!<br>
After picking up your 5th login stamp, you'll unlock the {{Color|#FF0000|'''limited edition Special Unit "'''}}[[Coin Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Coin Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#FF0000|'''"'''}}!<br>
Don't miss out on these free rewards - log in every day!<br>
<small></mall>※ After unlocking Coin Cat, visit the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu to activate it!</small></small>

